Industrial Xfwm4 theme, version 0.2

Industrial xfwm4 theme, recoloured to match the Industrial GTK3/GTK4 theme colour scheme.
Original artwork: Ximian Desktop 2 default window decoration, ported by Ercin EKER "caldera". GNU/GPL.

Colours: the title bar, frame and button colours are symbolic (active_color_1, active_hilight_1, active_shadow_1, ...), so Xfwm4
takes them from the GTK theme in use instead of using fixed values. Title text colours are not set in themerc, so they follow
the GTK theme as well. The shapes are unchanged from the original; the former smooth title gradient is now a flat base
colour with a highlight line on top and a dark line below, which is all the symbolic colours allow.

Buttons: the button faces are a flat base-colour body with a highlight edge (darker when pressed), so they follow the colour scheme.
Stripes: the horizontal lines of the original title bar are kept as thin rows of the highlight colour on every second row.
Side frame: the side strips use the highlight colour, as the lighter side frame of the original does.
Frame width: the side and bottom frame is one pixel thinner than the original (4 pixels instead of 5).
